      "id": "note",
      "kind": "note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 768,
      "w": 352,
      "h": 192,
      "label": "Notes",
      "props": {
        "text": "Blocks go device to object storage with presigned URLs; only metadata goes through the API. The metadata DB is 128 namespace shards, each a primary plus 2 replicas, one copy per AZ: each AZ box holds a full copy of all 128 shards and leads about a third of them, so losing a zone promotes replicas elsewhere instead of losing shards. Change events come from the journal by CDC, so the notifier path carries a doorbell only; correctness lives in the journal and cursors. Sized for the 3x peak with one AZ lost (30 API instances per AZ)."
      }
    }
